 #edb/ref 17592186502215 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502210 1058 #edb/ref 17592186502209 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502210 1061 621944 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502210 1062 #uuid "f8abbf23-8275-57f4-b19a-767b1595b9d0" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502210 1063 #edb/ref 17592186502069 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502211 1058 #edb/ref 17592186502201 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502211 1062 #uuid "fa9eb203-df95-5fc2-b810-2b8d0e2ec533" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502211 1063 #edb/ref 17592186360739 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502212 1062 #uuid "fb99b038-1031-5a63-aed5-c29598b71cc2" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502212 1063 #edb/ref 17592186278312 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502213 1058 #edb/ref 17592186502184 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502213 1062 #uuid "fd04f09e-0dfd-514c-b0d1-078c32dd4101" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502213 1063 #edb/ref 17592186404156 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502214 1062 #uuid "febf91cb-77cd-5e1e-bba8-c5ccf63dd284" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502214 1063 #edb/ref 17592186502126 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502215 1064 "Sometimes we know the total change in a quantity and want to find how much the quantity changes during each equal time period.\n\nIn these situations, we use division.\n\nFor example, suppose a total of $\\[math]24$ is withdrawn from a bank account over $6$ days in equal amounts.\n\nSince money is withdrawn, the total change in the balance is $-\\[/math]24$.\n\nTo find the change each day, we divide the total change by the number of days:\n\n$$\n-24 \\div 6\n$$\n\nEvaluating the quotient, we get\n\n$$\n-24 \\div 6 = -4.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the balance changes by $-\\[math]4$ each day." 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502215 1065 15182 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502215 1066 #uuid "2472ba13-0b69-56f2-a477-ea1b2a6fc7e3" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502215 1067 "Solving Problems Using Division of Rational Numbers" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502216 1064 "Some real-world situations involve a quantity changing by the same amount repeatedly.\n\nWhen the same change occurs repeatedly, we can represent the total change using multiplication.\n\nFor example, suppose a submarine begins at sea level and descends $2\\,\\text{m}$ each minute for $4$ minutes.\n\nSince descending represents a decrease in elevation, the change each minute is $-2\\,\\text{m}.$\n\nThe total change can be written as repeated subtraction:\n\n![](images/bd/bd6e5218d475c46dd7f0ac578340124954d00fa940c81e32bffa49638b0e79c3.svg)\n\nThis repeated subtraction can also be written using multiplication:\n\n$$\n{\\color{blue}4} \\times (-2)\n$$\n\nEvaluating the product, we get\n\n$$\n4 \\times (-2) = -8.\n$$\n\nTherefore, after $4$ minutes, the submarine's elevation is $-8\\,\\text{m}.$" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502216 1065 15164 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502216 1066 #uuid "e61ac714-2900-508a-9e66-9731f70e9997" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true] [17592186502216 1067 "Introduction" 13194139535388 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-1f1e2e98-3f29-5a8d-b619-48f3bdf693dc" 17592186501452 "activity-68961a22-241c-5590-ba4b-ccd92cb14402" 17592186501453 "activity-6d08b23d-f09b-57ac-8094-5a3a4b9cb9fe" 17592186501454 "activity-6e99407a-bbb3-5be2-9242-96bf986482bc" 17592186501455 "activity-890e7c6c-adee-5d25-828e-7834d97d256f" 17592186501456 "activity-bb7e0a0d-8752-5c3e-8395-2d6ad354306a" 17592186501457 "activity-bed47464-d195-5767-9ce4-9199db42db0b" 17592186501458 "activity-c6f0a606-7357-5b62-ba3e-c7abaf986519" 17592186501459 "activity-ccf00ea8-24df-5710-b43a-322d9402d168" 17592186501460 "activity-eb6c5be4-36dc-53c7-bba2-d203e8249edd" 17592186501461 "answer-00206c99-c52e-5e11-a583-8f426daa9681" 1